Package: fosos-theme
Version: 0.7.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: fonts-inter, fonts-liberation, dmz-cursor-theme, plymouth, plymouth-label, lxpolkit
Recommends: plymouth-themes
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: FosOS desktop branding and defaults
 Wallpaper, Dawn Aperture logo, quiet GRUB theme, graphical Plymouth
 splash (logo + spinner), session defaults, and touchpad tap-to-click.
 The FosOS LightDM greeter and desktop GTK/icon themes ship in
 fosos-desktop (Adwaita icons as fallback). lxpolkit provides password
 prompts.
